Z.ai / ZCode official plugins (installer bundle)
------------------------------------------------

EvoFlow desktop installers may ship a curated set of official plugins under
``evoflow/plugins/bundled_official`` (built from
``backend/packaging/official-plugins-bundle``, which is populated at build time
and is not committed as binary blobs). Those plugins are Z.ai (ZCode) product
artifacts redistributed with the installer so the in-app marketplace is usable
offline on first launch.

Typical plugin ids and stated licenses (from each plugin's ``plugin.json``;
verify against the packaged copy):

* browser-use, computer-use, node-repl-host, plugin-creator, skill-creator — MIT
* documents, pdf, presentations, spreadsheets, image-search — Apache-2.0

Publisher metadata in those manifests identifies Z.ai. Redistribution here is
for EvoFlow product packaging only; it does **not** grant trademark rights in
Z.AI / ZCode names or logos, and it does not change this repository's primary
license for non-plugin portions of EvoFlow. If you redistribute installers,
retain this notice and the license texts shipped inside each plugin package.

